# Keep the Docker build context small. The only Dockerfile in this repository
# (test/deploy/basic/Dockerfile) copies bin/* and test/deploy/basic/* only, so
# nothing of what is ignored below is needed to build an image. A smaller
# context makes `docker build` and the GitHub Actions cache upload faster.
.git
.github
*.md
coverage.out
coverage.html
tools/build
bin/*.exe
